  "forum.project2.about": { "pt-BR": "Criação de um banco físico e digital de propágulos e sementes de diferentes espécies de mangue da região costeira de Pernambuco. O acervo inclui catalogação genética, dados de origem geográfica e protocolos de armazenamento e reidratação para uso em programas de restauração.", "en-US": "Creation of a physical and digital bank of propagules and seeds from different mangrove species on the coast of Pernambuco. The collection includes genetic cataloguing, geographic origin data and storage and rehydration protocols for use in restoration programs.", es: "Creation of a physical and digital bank of propagules and seeds from different mangrove species on the coast of Pernambuco. The collection includes genetic cataloguing, geographic origin data and storage and rehydration protocols for use in restoration programs.", fr: "Creation of a physical and digital bank of propagules and seeds from different mangrove species on the coast of Pernambuco. The collection includes genetic cataloguing, geographic origin data and storage and rehydration protocols for use in restoration programs.", de: "Creation of a physical and digital bank of propagules and seeds from different mangrove species on the coast of Pernambuco. The collection includes genetic cataloguing, geographic origin data and storage and rehydration protocols for use in restoration programs.", it: "Creation of a physical and digital bank of propagules and seeds from different mangrove species on the coast of Pernambuco. The collection includes genetic cataloguing, geographic origin data and storage and rehydration protocols for use in restoration programs." },
  "forum.project2.why": { "pt-BR": "A perda de diversidade genética nos manguezais remanescentes dificulta programas de restauração baseados em replantio. O laboratório identificou que não havia nenhum repositório regional de material genético vegetal costeiro. O projeto nasceu como resposta direta a essa lacuna, com apoio da CAPES e do IBAMA.", "en-US": "The loss of genetic diversity in remaining mangroves hinders restoration programs based on replanting. The laboratory identified that there was no regional repository of coastal plant genetic material. The project was born as a direct response to this gap, with support from CAPES and IBAMA.", es: "The loss of genetic diversity in remaining mangroves hinders restoration programs based on replanting. The laboratory identified that there was no regional repository of coastal plant genetic material. The project was born as a direct response to this gap, with support from CAPES and IBAMA.", fr: "The loss of genetic diversity in remaining mangroves hinders restoration programs based on replanting. The laboratory identified that there was no regional repository of coastal plant genetic material. The project was born as a direct response to this gap, with support from CAPES and IBAMA.", de: "The loss of genetic diversity in remaining mangroves hinders restoration programs based on replanting. The laboratory identified that there was no regional repository of coastal plant genetic material. The project was born as a direct response to this gap, with support from CAPES and IBAMA.", it: "The loss of genetic diversity in remaining mangroves hinders restoration programs based on replanting. The laboratory identified that there was no regional repository of coastal plant genetic material. The project was born as a direct response to this gap, with support from CAPES and IBAMA." },
