  "forum.project3.about": { "pt-BR": "Aplicativo colaborativo que permite a qualquer cidadão registrar ocorrências ambientais em manguezais — como desmatamento, descarte ilegal de resíduos, mortandade de fauna — com fotos e geolocalização. Os dados alimentam um painel público em tempo real integrado com órgãos ambientais.", "en-US": "Collaborative application that allows any citizen to report environmental occurrences in mangroves — such as deforestation, illegal waste dumping, wildlife death — with photos and geolocation. The data feeds a real-time public panel integrated with environmental agencies.", es: "Collaborative application that allows any citizen to report environmental occurrences in mangroves — such as deforestation, illegal waste dumping, wildlife death — with photos and geolocation. The data feeds a real-time public panel integrated with environmental agencies.", fr: "Collaborative application that allows any citizen to report environmental occurrences in mangroves — such as deforestation, illegal waste dumping, wildlife death — with photos and geolocation. The data feeds a real-time public panel integrated with environmental agencies.", de: "Collaborative application that allows any citizen to report environmental occurrences in mangroves — such as deforestation, illegal waste dumping, wildlife death — with photos and geolocation. The data feeds a real-time public panel integrated with environmental agencies.", it: "Collaborative application that allows any citizen to report environmental occurrences in mangroves — such as deforestation, illegal waste dumping, wildlife death — with photos and geolocation. The data feeds a real-time public panel integrated with environmental agencies." },
  "forum.project3.why": { "pt-BR": "A fiscalização ambiental tem limitações de equipe e cobertura territorial. Ao mesmo tempo, moradores locais frequentemente presenciam impactos antes de qualquer órgão oficial. A ideia surgiu de uma conversa entre os três criadores durante uma saída de campo, quando viram um despejo ilegal de efluentes e não sabiam para onde reportar.", "en-US": "Environmental oversight has limitations in staff and territorial coverage. Local residents often witness impacts before any official agency. The idea arose from a conversation between the three creators during a field trip, when they saw an illegal effluent discharge and didn't know where to report it.", es: "Environmental oversight has limitations in staff and territorial coverage. Local residents often witness impacts before any official agency. The idea arose from a conversation between the three creators during a field trip, when they saw an illegal effluent discharge and didn't know where to report it.", fr: "Environmental oversight has limitations in staff and territorial coverage. Local residents often witness impacts before any official agency. The idea arose from a conversation between the three creators during a field trip, when they saw an illegal effluent discharge and didn't know where to report it.", de: "Environmental oversight has limitations in staff and territorial coverage. Local residents often witness impacts before any official agency. The idea arose from a conversation between the three creators during a field trip, when they saw an illegal effluent discharge and didn't know where to report it.", it: "Environmental oversight has limitations in staff and territorial coverage. Local residents often witness impacts before any official agency. The idea arose from a conversation between the three creators during a field trip, when they saw an illegal effluent discharge and didn't know where to report it." },
