  "forum.event1.desc": { "pt-BR": "Quatro dias de imersão em temas ambientais, com palestras, oficinas práticas, exposições e rodas de conversa. O evento reúne estudantes, professores e especialistas para discutir restauração de manguezais, tecnologias verdes e economia circular.", "en-US": "Four days of immersion in environmental topics, with lectures, practical workshops, exhibitions and roundtables. The event brings together students, teachers and experts to discuss mangrove restoration, green technologies and circular economy.", es: "Four days of immersion in environmental topics, with lectures, practical workshops, exhibitions and roundtables. The event brings together students, teachers and experts to discuss mangrove restoration, green technologies and circular economy.", fr: "Four days of immersion in environmental topics, with lectures, practical workshops, exhibitions and roundtables. The event brings together students, teachers and experts to discuss mangrove restoration, green technologies and circular economy.", de: "Four days of immersion in environmental topics, with lectures, practical workshops, exhibitions and roundtables. The event brings together students, teachers and experts to discuss mangrove restoration, green technologies and circular economy.", it: "Four days of immersion in environmental topics, with lectures, practical workshops, exhibitions and roundtables. The event brings together students, teachers and experts to discuss mangrove restoration, green technologies and circular economy." },
