  "forum.event2.desc": { "pt-BR": "Workshop hands-on para quem quer aprender a montar sensores ambientais com ESP32 e Arduino. Os participantes constroem um protótipo funcional de monitoramento de qualidade do ar e água, do zero até a transmissão de dados em tempo real.", "en-US": "Hands-on workshop for learning to build environmental sensors with ESP32 and Arduino. Participants build a functional air and water quality monitoring prototype, from scratch to real-time data transmission.", es: "Hands-on workshop for learning to build environmental sensors with ESP32 and Arduino. Participants build a functional air and water quality monitoring prototype, from scratch to real-time data transmission.", fr: "Hands-on workshop for learning to build environmental sensors with ESP32 and Arduino. Participants build a functional air and water quality monitoring prototype, from scratch to real-time data transmission.", de: "Hands-on workshop for learning to build environmental sensors with ESP32 and Arduino. Participants build a functional air and water quality monitoring prototype, from scratch to real-time data transmission.", it: "Hands-on workshop for learning to build environmental sensors with ESP32 and Arduino. Participants build a functional air and water quality monitoring prototype, from scratch to real-time data transmission." },
