  "forum.post2.comment1.text": { "pt-BR": "Artigo fantástico! As 47 espécies identificadas reforçam a importância da preservação dos rizomas. Parabéns pela pesquisa!", "en-US": "Fantastic article! The 47 identified species reinforce the importance of preserving the rhizomes. Congratulations on the research!", es: "Fantastic article! The 47 identified species reinforce the importance of preserving the rhizomes. Congratulations on the research!", fr: "Fantastic article! The 47 identified species reinforce the importance of preserving the rhizomes. Congratulations on the research!", de: "Fantastic article! The 47 identified species reinforce the importance of preserving the rhizomes. Congratulations on the research!", it: "Fantastic article! The 47 identified species reinforce the importance of preserving the rhizomes. Congratulations on the research!" },
