  "forum.post2.comment2.text": { "pt-BR": "Consegui acessar o artigo, muito bem escrito. Você considerou incluir dados sobre espécies migratórias também?", "en-US": "I was able to access the article, very well written. Did you consider including data on migratory species too?", es: "I was able to access the article, very well written. Did you consider including data on migratory species too?", fr: "I was able to access the article, very well written. Did you consider including data on migratory species too?", de: "I was able to access the article, very well written. Did you consider including data on migratory species too?", it: "I was able to access the article, very well written. Did you consider including data on migratory species too?" },
