  "forum.post4.title": { "pt-BR": "Dúvida: como integrar dados do ESP32 com uma API REST?", "en-US": "Question: how to integrate ESP32 data with a REST API?", es: "Question: how to integrate ESP32 data with a REST API?", fr: "Question: how to integrate ESP32 data with a REST API?", de: "Question: how to integrate ESP32 data with a REST API?", it: "Question: how to integrate ESP32 data with a REST API?" },
  "forum.post4.content": { "pt-BR": "Oi pessoal! Estou tentando conectar meu ESP32 a uma API REST para enviar as leituras dos sensores, mas estou tendo problemas com autenticação via token. Alguém já passou por isso? Já testei com ArduinoHttpClient mas o certificado SSL não está sendo aceito.", "en-US": "Hi everyone! I am trying to connect my ESP32 to a REST API to send sensor readings, but I am having issues with token authentication. Has anyone been through this? I have already tested with ArduinoHttpClient but the SSL certificate is not being accepted.", es: "Hi everyone! I am trying to connect my ESP32 to a REST API to send sensor readings, but I am having issues with token authentication. Has anyone been through this? I have already tested with ArduinoHttpClient but the SSL certificate is not being accepted.", fr: "Hi everyone! I am trying to connect my ESP32 to a REST API to send sensor readings, but I am having issues with token authentication. Has anyone been through this? I have already tested with ArduinoHttpClient but the SSL certificate is not being accepted.", de: "Hi everyone! I am trying to connect my ESP32 to a REST API to send sensor readings, but I am having issues with token authentication. Has anyone been through this? I have already tested with ArduinoHttpClient but the SSL certificate is not being accepted.", it: "Hi everyone! I am trying to connect my ESP32 to a REST API to send sensor readings, but I am having issues with token authentication. Has anyone been through this? I have already tested with ArduinoHttpClient but the SSL certificate is not being accepted." },
