  "forum.post7.title": { "pt-BR": "Impactos do bio-plástico no mangue", "en-US": "Impacts of bio-plastic on the mangrove", es: "Impacts of bio-plastic on the mangrove", fr: "Impacts of bio-plastic on the mangrove", de: "Impacts of bio-plastic on the mangrove", it: "Impacts of bio-plastic on the mangrove" },
  "forum.post7.content": { "pt-BR": "Tenho estudado os efeitos dos bio-plásticos em ecossistemas de manguezal e os dados são preocupantes mesmo para materiais ditos \"biodegradáveis\". A decomposição desses polímeros libera compostos que alteram o pH do sedimento, afetando diretamente a flora e fauna nativa. Alguém aqui já trabalhou com análise de microplásticos em amostras de sedimento de manguezal? Quero comparar metodologias.", "en-US": "I have been studying the effects of bio-plastics on mangrove ecosystems and the data is concerning even for materials labeled as \"biodegradable\". The decomposition of these polymers releases compounds that alter the sediment pH, directly affecting the native flora and fauna. Has anyone here worked with microplastic analysis in mangrove sediment samples? I want to compare methodologies.", es: "I have been studying the effects of bio-plastics on mangrove ecosystems and the data is concerning even for materials labeled as \"biodegradable\". The decomposition of these polymers releases compounds that alter the sediment pH, directly affecting the native flora and fauna. Has anyone here worked with microplastic analysis in mangrove sediment samples? I want to compare methodologies.", fr: "I have been studying the effects of bio-plastics on mangrove ecosystems and the data is concerning even for materials labeled as \"biodegradable\". The decomposition of these polymers releases compounds that alter the sediment pH, directly affecting the native flora and fauna. Has anyone here worked with microplastic analysis in mangrove sediment samples? I want to compare methodologies.", de: "I have been studying the effects of bio-plastics on mangrove ecosystems and the data is concerning even for materials labeled as \"biodegradable\". The decomposition of these polymers releases compounds that alter the sediment pH, directly affecting the native flora and fauna. Has anyone here worked with microplastic analysis in mangrove sediment samples? I want to compare methodologies.", it: "I have been studying the effects of bio-plastics on mangrove ecosystems and the data is concerning even for materials labeled as \"biodegradable\". The decomposition of these polymers releases compounds that alter the sediment pH, directly affecting the native flora and fauna. Has anyone here worked with microplastic analysis in mangrove sediment samples? I want to compare methodologies." },
